            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Compared with a physician's choice of either methotrexate or bexarotene, the CD30-directed antibody-drug conjugate brentuximab vedotin led to significantly superior clinical responses in patients with cutaneous T-cell lymphomas, according to the results of the international phase III ALCANZA trial.</AbstractText>
